  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Artifact
  artifactName: Spider Brooch
  description: "\nMetal, with a stone set in the abdomen.\n\nI thought it was a small
    creature that could come alive. Not a decoration \u2014 a pet that was pretending.\n\nI
    used to check on it. I\u2019m not sure what I expected to find."
  normalMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: b26b924586ca76f409d20f6b5714f0b2, type: 2}
